{
  "about": "The matching fixture set (SPEC.md section 5.3). Each group has an anchor (the product the user tracks) and the result the matcher must give for every other saved page in the group. A list means either result is acceptable. Pages are real snapshots in pages/, listed in pages.json. Checked by hand on 2026-11-01.",
  "groups": [
    {
